{"ID":"20240506112401-jhui8lg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506112401-jhui8lg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506112401-jhui8lg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506112401-rsqoelc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614121852-xaszv9p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614122348-jjed18x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"375补18鸡子黄（鸡蛋黄）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828143419"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704174029-ezrq0f4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704174029-ezrq0f4","updated":"20240704174029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 466px;","style":"width: 456px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋2-20240704174029-hug3vc3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 456px;\" parent-style=\"width: 466px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704173915-fb4kgnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704173915-fb4kgnc","updated":"20240704173915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 466px;","style":"width: 456px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋-20240704173915-kcby4o9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 456px;\" parent-style=\"width: 466px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828143419-htxbqkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828143419-htxbqkt","updated":"20240828143419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704174215-fqnr22n.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 633px;","style":"width: 623px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704174338-1qlzpak.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 623px;\" parent-style=\"width: 633px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704174155-f6kvzgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704174155-f6kvzgy","updated":"20240828143357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"母鸡"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/母鸡-20240828143357-moifmzr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 646px;","style":"width: 636px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡蛋3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡蛋3-20240704174155-jblabb4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 636px;\" parent-style=\"width: 646px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614121848-pou9ddp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614121848-pou9ddp"}},{"ID":"20240614122409-jzmdg8e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614122409-jzmdg8e","updated":"20240614122414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡子黄《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614122409-7q8udm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614122409-7q8udm1","updated":"20240614122409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温，味甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614122409-qzjiu8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614122409-qzjiu8s","updated":"20240614122409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶阴不足，补之以血。若咽有疮，鸡子一枚，去黄，苦酒倾壳中，以半夏入苦酒中，取壳，置刀环上，熬微沸。去渣，旋旋呷之。又主除热，火疮痫痉。可作琥珀神物。黄，和恒山末，为丸，竹叶汤服，治久疟不差；黄，合须发煎，消为水，疗小儿惊热、下痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121848-972e1fa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614121848-972e1fa"}},{"ID":"20240614122348-jjed18x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614122348-jjed18x","updated":"20240614122435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡蛋黄《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614122348-nmi2qas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614122348-nmi2qas","updated":"20240614122348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡蛋黄："}]},{"ID":"20240614122348-mcl4kkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614122348-mcl4kkq","updated":"20240614122348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、赤白痢。用鸡蛋一术，取黄去白，加胡粉满壳，烧存性，酒送服一匙。"}]},{"ID":"20240614122348-attshoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614122348-attshoj","updated":"20240614122348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小儿疾。用鸡蛋黄和乳汁搅服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614122348-65wj7xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614122348-65wj7xr","updated":"20240614122348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小儿头疮。取熟鸡蛋黄，炒令油出，调麻油、腻粉涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614122348-88qukep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614122348-88qukep","updated":"20240614122348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、消灭瘢痕。用鸡蛋五、七枚煮熟。取黄炒黑，一天涂三次，直至瘢痕消灭。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121848-d4d7s8u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614121848-d4d7s8u"}},{"ID":"20240614121901-5g65g3n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614121901-5g65g3n","updated":"20240614122108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡子黄《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614121901-litgkit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121901-litgkit","updated":"20240614121901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】无"}]},{"ID":"20240614121901-9395w5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121901-9395w5h","updated":"20240614121901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温，入足太阴脾、足阳明胃经。补脾精而益胃液，止泄利而断呕吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121901-u1j27d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121901-u1j27d0","updated":"20240614121901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《伤寒》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连阿胶汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在阿胶。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治少阴病，心中烦，不得卧者。以其补脾而润燥也。《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"百合鸡子汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在百合。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治百合病，吐之后者，以其涤胃而降逆也。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"排脓散"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在桔梗。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之，以其补中脘而生血肉也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121901-9nkzezy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121901-9nkzezy","updated":"20240614121901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡子黄温润淳浓，体备土德，滋脾胃之精液，泽中脘之枯槁，降浊阴而止呕吐，升清阳而断泄利，补中之良药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121901-3mnbw2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121901-3mnbw2i","updated":"20240614121901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煎油治小儿湿热诸疮，甚效。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"鸡子白在三卷中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121848-j4eeqtu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614121848-j4eeqtu"}},{"ID":"20240614121849-5fb4kul","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-5fb4kul","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：鸡子黄"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-csn9sym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-csn9sym","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-sdw1fj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-sdw1fj4","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Jī Zǐ Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-lcgpwiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-lcgpwiu","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-nxod0g6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-nxod0g6","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鸡卵黄（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-lghq0lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-lghq0lv","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-u8rsw97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-u8rsw97","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-ygtz9i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-ygtz9i4","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-a202d8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-a202d8i","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为雉科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"家鸡"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛋黄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-dhbhybn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-dhbhybn","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-9jjlccx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-9jjlccx","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 每100克含蛋白质13.6克，脂类30克，碳水化物1克，灰分1.6克；钙134毫克，磷532毫克，铁7毫克；维生素A3500国际单位，硫胺素0.27毫克，核黄素0.35毫克，尼克酸微量，对氨基苯甲酸（干燥卵黄）0.8微克／克。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-x5ck1bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-x5ck1bt","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛋白质有卵黄磷蛋白、卵黄球蛋白，其含率比约为3.6：1。还含至少5种唾液酸糖蛋白。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-srwqiqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-srwqiqx","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡子黄含大量脂肪性物质（鸡子白只含约0.1％），其中约10％是磷脂，而磷脂中又以卵磷脂为主；上述卵黄磷蛋白，在鸡子黄中就是与卵磷脂相结合的。脂肪性物质中的脂肪酸，主要是油酸（占脂肪酸46.7％）、亚油酸（19％）、亚麻酸（2.9％）、饱和酸（31.4％）。又鸡子黄含胆甾醇约1.3％，葡萄糖（化合及游离）约0.3％。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-1ule7jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-1ule7jh","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还含叶黄素和叶黄素的多种异构物，也含少量胡萝卜素。因饲料能影响蛋黄的颜色，肯定蛋黄还含其它种种色素。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-ll6juzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-ll6juzu","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-wfj2agi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-wfj2agi","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-4j88dwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-4j88dwh","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《长沙药解》：\"入足太阴脾、足阳明胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-h5vu6ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-h5vu6ir","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入心、肺、肾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-de63kk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-de63kk4","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-qv7do55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-qv7do55","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-tjjqtlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-tjjqtlw","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《千金·食治》：\"微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-ygsi7r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-ygsi7r2","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"味甘，性平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-beq62uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-beq62uc","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-vmc66f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-vmc66f3","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草求真》：\"多食则滞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-8qnqh8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-8qnqh8t","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-r9uer05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-r9uer05","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 滋阴润燥，养血息风。治心烦不得眠，热病痉厥，虚劳吐血，呕逆，下痢，胎漏下血，烫伤，热疮，湿疹，小儿消化不良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-m1rw22a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-m1rw22a","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"和常山末为丸，竹叶煎汤下，治久疟不差。治漆疮，涂之。醋煮，治产后虚及痢，主小儿发热。煎服，主痢，除烦热。炼之，主呕逆。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-ztpxquo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-ztpxquo","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《千金·食治》：\"主除热，火灼，烂疮，痓。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-leexfn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-leexfn8","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"炒取油，和粉敷头疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-cw7z1gc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-cw7z1gc","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"补阴血，解热毒，治下痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-wm4fe0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-wm4fe0p","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草再新》：\"补中益气，养肾益阴，润肺止咳，治虚芳吐血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-8lu886t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-8lu886t","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-6id13l7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-6id13l7","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：生服、煮食或以药汁冲服。外用：调药涂或煮熟熬油涂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-nzqqm5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-nzqqm5t","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-nz9tma8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-nz9tma8","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①少阴病，得之二、三日以上，心中烦，不得眠：黄连四两，黄芩二两，芍药二两，鸡子黄二枚，阿胶三两。上五味，以水六升，先煮三物，取二升，去滓，纳胶烊尽，小冷，纳鸡子黄，搅令相得，温服七合，日三服。（《伤寒论》黄连阿胶汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-9dyjhq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-9dyjhq0","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治温邪久踞下焦，既厥且哕，脉细而劲：鸡子黄一枚（生用），真阿胶二钱，生龟版六钱，童便一杯，淡菜三钱。水五杯，先煮龟版、淡菜，约二杯，去滓人间胶，上火烊化，纳鸡子黄，搅令相得，再冲童便，顿服之。（《温病条辨》小定风珠）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-7zyzkf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-7zyzkf8","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小儿惊痼：鸡子黄和乳汁，量儿大小服之。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-mth6xnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-mth6xnz","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治卒干呕不息：破鸡子去白，吞中黄数枚。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-v7xhc33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-v7xhc33","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治卒腹痛下赤白痢，数日不绝：鸡卵一枚，取出黄，去白，纳胡粉令满，壳烧成屑，以酒服一钱匕。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-ioeahew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-ioeahew","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治妊娠血下不止，名曰漏胎，血尽子死：鸡子十四枚，取黄，以好酒二升煮，使如饧，一服之未瘥，更作服之，以瘥为度。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-0xwr3so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-0xwr3so","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治孩子热疮：鸡子五枚（去白取黄），乱发如鸡子许大。二味相和于铁铫子中，炭火熬，初甚干，少顷即发焦，遂有液出，旋取置一瓷碗中，以液尽为度，取涂热疮上，即以苦参末粉之。（刘禹锡《传信方》乱发鸡子膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-zp5ki6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-zp5ki6e","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治热毒疮瘥后，瘢痕不灭：鸡子一枚（酒浸七日后取黄），白僵蚕三七枚（捣末）。上药与鸡子相和令匀，先以布揩疮瘢赤痛，涂之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-939kl4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-939kl4n","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治烧伤、湿疹、耳脓：卵黄油加冰片少许，涂上。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-2bw1c8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-2bw1c8g","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治脚上臭疮：熟鸡子黄一个，黄蜡一钱。煎油涂之。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-qqymzm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-qqymzm3","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治鼠瘘：鸡卵一枚，米下蒸半日，取出黄，熬令黑，先拭疮上汁令干，以药纳疮孔中。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-nnd8jkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-nnd8jkv","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-l95rbwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-l95rbwu","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗烧伤"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-bfzupbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-bfzupbh","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将鸡蛋煮熟，去壳取蛋黄，置铜锅内以文火加热，待水分蒸发后再用大火，即熬出蛋黄油，过滤装瓶，高压灭菌备用。用时，将蛋黄油直接涂在经清创处理的烧伤创面上，以暴露疗法为佳。治疗100余例一、二度中小面积烧伤，均获良好效果，未发生继发感染。涂药后，创面有清凉感，疼痛减轻，渗出减少，结痂快，痂皮自行脱落，一般不留疤痕或疤痕不显。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-hqvr06i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-hqvr06i","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗静脉曲张性溃疡"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-9ys3e4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-9ys3e4v","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将煮熟的鸡蛋，去白留黄，研碎，置铜锅内加热熬出蛋黄油，贮于无菌磁器中备用。用时先清理创面，然后用浸有蛋黄油的棉片平敷于上，外加包扎。隔日或隔2日换药1次，至痊愈为止。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-x1qwr80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-x1qwr80","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗麻风溃疡"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-nl3r69w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-nl3r69w","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先清洗创面，并剪除疮缘过度角化皮肤组织及疮底不良肉芽组织；而后用滴管吸蛋黄油少许滴入疮口，再用复方黄连油膏（由黄连、黄柏、紫草、生地、当归、黄蜡、麻油煎熬而成）护盖包扎。隔1、2天换药1次。治疗麻风营养性溃疡8例，其中浅溃疡4例，3例治愈，1例接近痊愈；4例深溃疡，因年限长，骨质受损，疗效不显著。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-2ndzgqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-2ndzgqm","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗皮肤湿疹"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-uugevvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-uugevvm","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将蛋黄油直接涂抹患部，每日一次。一般用药后局部发红、渗液、瘙痒等即见减轻，经治3、5次即可获愈。如以蛋黄油和入儿茶、冰片，或三仙丹、雄黄，调抹患部，治疗皮癣、脚癣或头癣，亦均有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-fguqq98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-fguqq98","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疗小儿消化不良"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-r1l2v76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-r1l2v76","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛋黄油每天5～10毫升，分2次服。一疗程为4～5天。一般服药1～2天后大便次数及性状即明显好转，用药4～5天可痊愈。如用药2～3天后大便仍无好转，即不必继续服用。治疗20例婴儿患者，入院前或入院后均经多种抗菌素或中药治疗无效；粪便常规检查均见较多脂肪滴，部分病例发现少量白细胞，16例粪便培养均为阴性。经内服蛋黄油后，15例治愈，3例好转，2例无效。平均疗程为3.4天。以对婴幼儿慢性或迁延性消化不良疗效最为满意"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-bdqrpla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-bdqrpla","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-zkfrwwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-zkfrwwb","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"鸡子黄，气味俱厚，故能补形，昔人谓其与阿胶同功，正此意也。其治呕逆诸疮，则取其除热引虫而已。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-tlvbfa3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-tlvbfa3","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《长沙药解》：\"鸡子黄，补脾精而益胃液，止泄利而断呕吐。《伤寒》黄连阿胶汤，用之治少阴病，心中烦，不得卧者，以其补牌而润燥也。《金匮》百合鸡子汤，用之治百合病吐之后者，以其涤胃而降逆也。排脓散，用之以其补中脘而生血肉也。\"\"温润淳浓，滋脾胃之精液，泽中脘之枯槁，降浊阴而止呕吐，升清阳而断泄利，补中之良药也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-lk7xqcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-lk7xqcc","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-oollgmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-oollgmq","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-05e0rot","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-05e0rot","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：鸡子黄"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-kfe0s3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-kfe0s3q","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-mfo8r26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-mfo8r26","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Jī Zǐ Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-ve22npl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-ve22npl","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-sjt66zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-sjt66zj","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鸡卵黄、鸡蛋黄"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-5kewiwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-5kewiwa","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-g7b5nc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-g7b5nc9","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yolk"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-pmt7b76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-pmt7b76","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-0h1udr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-0h1udr6","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《名医别录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-hgbfr90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-hgbfr90","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-mvacyu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-mvacyu4","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为雉科动物家鸡的蛋黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-0jiyo0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-0jiyo0e","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Gallus gallus domesticus Brisson"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-i1p60vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-i1p60vn","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-seg5obc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-seg5obc","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：家鸡因饲养杂交的关系，口种繁多，形体大小及毛色不一。食物主要为植物的种子、果实及昆虫等。雄鸡善啼。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-epvbcnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-epvbcnw","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：全国各地均有饲养。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-owes2ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-owes2ez","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-8avmohw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-8avmohw","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 家鸡，家禽。嘴短而坚，略呈圆锥状，上嘴稍弯曲。鼻孔裂状，被有鳞状瓣。眼有瞬膜。头上有肉冠，喉部两侧有肉垂，通常呈褐红色；肉冠以雄者为高大，雌者低小；肉垂亦以雄者为大。翼短；羽色雌、雄不同，雄者羽色较美，有长而鲜丽的尾羽；雌者尾羽甚短。足健壮，跗、跖及趾均被有鳞板；趾4，前3趾，后1趾，后趾短小，位略高，雄者跗跖部后方有距。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-3o04s7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-3o04s7s","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-3nkhjrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-3nkhjrh","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 每100g卵含含蛋白质(protein)13.6g，脂类(lipids)30g，碳水化合物(carbohydrate)1g，灰分(ash)1.6g；钙134mg，磷532mg，铁7mg；维生素(vitamin)A3500u，硫胺素(thiamine)0.27mg，核黄素(riboflavin)0.35mg，烟酸(nicotinic acid)微量，对氨基苯甲酸(p-aminobenzoic acid)(干燥卵黄)0.8μg/g。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-hpljgpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-hpljgpl","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛋白质有卵黄磷蛋白(vitellin)、卵黄球蛋白(livetin)，其含率比约为3.6：1。还含至少5种唾液酸糖蛋白(sialoglycoprotein)。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-g3be50t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-g3be50t","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡子黄含大量脂肪性物质(鸡子白只含约0.1%，其中约10%是磷脂(phosopholipids)、而磷脂中又以卵磷脂(lecithin)为主；脂肪性物质中的脂肪酸(fatty acid)，主要是油酸(oleic acid)(占脂肪酸46.7%)、亚油酸(linoleic acid)19%、亚麻酸(linolenic acid)2.9%。饱和酸(swaturated fatty acid)31.4%。鸡子黄含胆甾醇(cholesterol)约1.3%，葡萄糖(化合及游离)约0.3%。还含叶黄素(lutein)和叶黄素的多种异构物，也含少量胡萝卜素(carotene)(不超过0.02mg／100g)。因饲料能影响蛋黄的颜色，肯定蛋黄还含其它种种色素。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-z91fop4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-z91fop4","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-trfpsxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-trfpsxq","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鸡子黄有镇静作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-b2cyb3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-b2cyb3g","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-uk715qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-uk715qj","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鲜蛋去壳，去净蛋白，留蛋黄备用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-611vgmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-611vgmn","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-il5sr80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-il5sr80","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；肾；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-nxbsq2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-nxbsq2z","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-0tclmz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-0tclmz3","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-9gqzqnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-9gqzqnz","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-h74mch8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-h74mch8","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 冠心病，高血压，动脉血管粥样硬化者慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-2anphg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-2anphg0","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-deh6oyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-deh6oyv","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 滋阴润燥；养血熄风。主心烦不得眠；热病痉厥；虚劳吐血；呕逆；下痢；烫伤；热疮；肝炎；小儿消化不良"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-a6krpny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-a6krpny","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-il9pxoi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-il9pxoi","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煮食，1-3枚；或生服。外用；适量，涂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-17k9ab0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-17k9ab0","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-2wyu2ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-2wyu2ez","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草纲目》：鸡子黄，气味俱厚，故能补形，昔人谓其与阿胶同功，正此意也。其治呕逆诸疮，则取其除热引虫而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-4vyfqv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-4vyfqv9","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《长沙药解》：鸡子黄，补脾精而益胃液，止泄利而断呕吐。《伤寒》黄连阿胶汤，用之治少阴病，心中烦，不得卧者，以其补脾而润燥也。《金匮》百合鸡子汤，用之治百合病吐之后者，以其涤胃而降逆也。排脓散，用之以其补中脘而生血肉也。温润淳浓，滋脾胃之精液，泽中脘之枯槁，降浊阴而止呕吐，升清阳而断泄利，补中之良药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-r5u23ta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-r5u23ta","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：和常山末为丸，竹叶煎汤下，洽久疟不差。治漆疮，涂之。醋煮，治产后虚及痢，主小儿发热。煎服，主痢，除烦热。炼之，主呕逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-cqrqfg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-cqrqfg4","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《千金·食治》：主除热，火灼、烂疮，痓。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-g4f5c6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-g4f5c6v","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》：炒取油，和粉敷头疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-bn5f0dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-bn5f0dv","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草纲目》：补阴血，解热毒，治下痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-tc64uxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-tc64uxw","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草再新》：补中益气，养肾益阴，润肺止咳，治虚芳吐血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-d36f434","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-d36f434","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614121849-2d47ccw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121849-2d47ccw","updated":"20240614121849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614121851-mxgm0lu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614121851-mxgm0lu"}},{"ID":"20240614121852-xaszv9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614121852-xaszv9p"}}]}